      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It is objectively the ugliest cake I have ever seen in my life, and I love it so much",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 383
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The case with Aaron is now closed. There was no evidence tying him to me or the island, and the cops believe he skipped ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1299
        }
      ],
      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "These big, bad, tough guys have gone soft on me, and I want my crazy, rough men back",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2384
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s freaky watching myself stare back at me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5354
        }
      ],
      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I won’t let him win. Breathing deeply, I compose myself, and when the gate creaks, I don’t run",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12587
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You’re it for me, my one shot at redemption,” he whispers",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14586
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I am a word with no teeth. Lovers use me, monsters too. The lonely crave me and the hunted fear me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15825
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    }
